Port of RealAnalysisGame @ 930c383 to the wasm64 lean4game build (in-browser
kernel, essential Mathlib pack). No level or world is removed and nothing a
player types changes.

- Game/Metadata.lean: `Mathlib.Analysis.SpecialFunctions.Log.Base` is absent
  from the Mathlib pack this build ships and no level uses `Real.logb`; its
  two in-pack imports (Pow.Real, BigOperators.Field) replace it, plus
  `Mathlib.Tactic.Bound` for the taught `bound` tactic (previously reached
  transitively through Log.Base).
- Game/CustomTactic/Linarith.lean: qualify `Mathlib.Tactic.elabLinarithConfig`
  (core Lean now has a grind-based `Lean.Elab.Tactic.elabLinarithConfig`).
- Game/CustomTactic/PushNeg.lean (new, imported from Metadata): the macro
  Mathlib's own deprecation message recommends, so the taught `push_neg`
  (= `push Not` now) no longer logs "`push_neg` has been deprecated" in the
  player's view.
- 112 level files: column-0 `:= by` tactic blocks indented by two spaces.
  This Lean rejects a column-0 block once a term-ending tactic (`use 1`,
  `have h := …`, `refine …`) is followed by another tactic. Whitespace only;
  string literals (hint text) and the `/-- … -/` doc comments that feed
  TheoremDoc/DefinitionDoc verified unchanged line by line.
- L4Levels/L01_NonConverge.lean: local simp lemma
  `(-1 : ℝ) ^ (2 * n + 1) = -1` so the level's `bound` step still closes
  (this Mathlib's `bound` proves the even case, not the odd one).
- L22Levels/L03.lean: drop `attribute [grind]
  Mathlib.Tactic.Zify.natCast_le._simp_1` (constant gone; no level uses grind).

Requires the full Mathlib.Tactic.Cases (cases'/induction') from wasm/compat.
